cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "UR10e Robot Arm Catches a Thrown Ball with AI Prediction in MuJoCo"
abstract: >-
  A MuJoCo simulation of a UR10e robot arm with a passive cone-shaped cup that catches a thrown ball. The ball's
  flight model is identified from 90 real throws recorded with a Qualisys motion-capture system; a learned predictor
  forecasts the rest of a flight from its first observed points, a conservative decision says whether the ball can be
  caught, and the robot meets the ball in motion, with the catch simulated with contact. Every output is a simulation
  result; nothing is run on, or validated on, the real UR10e.
authors:
